---
const complianceModules = [
  {
    tag: "ENVELOPE & HVAC",
    title: "Prescriptive & Whole-Building EPI Verification",
    clauses: "ECBC Clauses 4.2, 4.3, 5.2 & Appendix D (EPI Ratio)",
    detail: "Automated checking of Window-to-Wall Ratio (WWR), roof and wall U-factor caps, solar heat gain coefficients (SHGC) across climate zones, and whole-building EPI ratio calculation for ECBC, ECBC+, and SuperECBC tiers."
  },
  {
    tag: "BUILDING SERVICES",
    title: "Daylighting, Ventilation & Thermal Comfort",
    clauses: "NBC 2016 Part 8: Sec. 1 (Lighting), Sec. 3 (HVAC)",
    detail: "Verifies minimum daylight factors, Spatial Daylight Autonomy (sDA), fresh air ach/cfm rates per occupancy category, and indoor thermal comfort conditions."
  },
  {
    tag: "STATUTORY CLAUSES",
    title: "Graph-RAG Statutory Clause Retrieval",
    clauses: "NBC Part 3 & 4: Height, FAR, Setbacks & Life Safety",
    detail: "Backed by our structured Graph-RAG knowledge base of the National Building Code, enabling our engineers to verify height, FAR, setback, and building systems clauses with exact section citations during design reviews."
  }
];
---

<section id="engine" class="py-24 lg:py-28 bg-[#F7F6F2] border-t border-slate-900/10 relative">
  <div class="w-full max-w-[1680px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 2xl:px-24 space-y-24">
    
    <!-- Part 1: Proprietary Engine + Native AI Integration -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left Narrative -->
      <div class="reveal lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/[0.04] border border-slate-900/10 text-slate-700 text-xs font-mono tracking-wider">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0"></span>
          <span>PROPRIETARY TECHNOLOGY</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight text-balance">
          First-principles physics meets native agentic AI.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          In conventional consulting, energy and daylight models take weeks to assemble across disconnected third-party tools—meaning engineering feedback often arrives after architectural decisions have already moved on.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          To change this, we built <strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Clearinfra Studio</strong> in-house. It combines an hourly ISO 13790 thermal &amp; psychrometric physics engine with a <strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">native function-calling AI agent</strong> and proactive Pareto optimizer.
        </p>

        <!-- 2 Pillar Cards on Stone -->
        <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-900/10 hover:border-emerald-600/40 transition-colors shadow-2xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-slate-400">01</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wider">Native AI Copilot &amp; Pareto Optimizer</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Wired directly into the 3D geometry and physics kernel via 12 engineering tools—allowing our consultants to sweep glazing, shading, orientation, and HVAC combinations live to isolate lowest-CAPEX and lowest-EPI designs.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-900/10 hover:border-emerald-600/40 transition-colors shadow-2xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-slate-400">02</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wider">Traceable Dependency Graph</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Every parameter change is tracked through a live dependency map—showing exactly how a change in facade SHGC propagates to sensible coil load, chiller tonnage, and project payback.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Matte CAD Window with Animated Architecture Schematic -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/60 ring-1 ring-white/10 bg-[#131924] p-5 sm:p-9 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-950/30 bg-blueprint-sub relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 sm:gap-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-5 sm:mb-6 pb-3.5 sm:pb-4 border-b border-white/[0.08]">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-slate-200 font-medium">
                <span class="sm:hidden">CLEARINFRA // SYSTEM TOPOLOGY</span>
